<script setup lang="ts">
import SiteNav from '../SiteNav.vue';
import {onMounted, onUnmounted, ref} from 'vue';
const state=ref('正在检查镜像服务'), count=ref('—'), size=ref('—');
const policies=ref<Record<string,string>>({});
const nodes=ref<{url:string,weight:number}[]>([]), accepting=ref(true);
const sourceCount=ref(0);
const loading=ref(true), controller=new AbortController();
const deadline=window.setTimeout(()=>controller.abort(),5000);
onUnmounted(()=>{controller.abort();window.clearTimeout(deadline);});
const modes:Record<string,string>={cache:'本地缓存',redirect:'官方重定向',backup:'备份并重定向',disabled:'本地关闭 · 官方下载'};
const endpoints=[['游戏核心','/mc/game/ · /v1/packages/ · /v1/objects/','Mojang','core'],['加载器','/maven/ · /fabric-meta/ · /quilt-meta/…','Forge / Fabric / Quilt / NeoForged','loaders'],['模组文件','/mods/modrinth/ · /mods/curseforge/','Modrinth / CurseForge','mods'],['Java 运行时','/java/v1/…','Mojang','java'],['游戏依赖','/maven/…','Mojang','libraries'],['原版资源','/assets/{前两位}/{SHA-1}','Mojang','assets']];
onMounted(async()=>{try{const response=await fetch('/mirror-api/status',{signal:controller.signal});if(!response.ok)throw Error();const data=await response.json();state.value=data.running?'镜像服务在线':'镜像服务待启动';policies.value=data.policies||{};nodes.value=data.nodes||[];accepting.value=data.accepting!==false;sourceCount.value=data.source_mappings||0;count.value=Number(data.cached_files||0).toLocaleString('zh-CN');size.value=((data.cached_bytes||0)/1024**3).toFixed(2)+' GiB';}catch{state.value='暂时无法读取镜像状态';}finally{loading.value=false;window.clearTimeout(deadline);}});
const mirrorAddress=window.location.origin;
const copyState=ref('复制地址');
async function copy(){try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(mirrorAddress);copyState.value='地址已复制';}catch{copyState.value='请手动复制下方地址';}}
</script>

<template>
<SiteNav />
<main class="mirror-page">
<section class="mirror-hero"><div class="mirror-hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A HOME FOR YOUR NEXT WORLD</div><h1>世界很大。<br><span>出发，近一点。</span></h1><p>游戏资源与共享译文，汇集在同一个地方。<br>为 Minecraft 启动器准备的独立资源镜像。</p><div class="mirror-actions"><a class="button" href="#mirror-connect">接入镜像 <span>↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/">探索译文库 →</a></div><div class="mirror-live"><span class="dot"></span>{{ state }}</div></div><div class="mirror-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mirror-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="mirror-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="mirror-cube"><span>B</span></div><span class="mirror-coordinate coordinate-one">ASSETS / LIBRARIES</span><span class="mirror-coordinate coordinate-two">CRAFT YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><div class="mirror-art-grid"></div></div></section>
<section class="mirror-facts" aria-label="镜像状态" :aria-busy="loading"><div><span>本地缓存文件</span><strong :class="{'loading-value':loading}">{{ count }}</strong></div><div><span>已缓存数据</span><strong :class="{'loading-value':loading}">{{ size }}</strong></div><div><span>文件校验</span><strong>SHA-1 / SHA-256</strong></div><div><span>内容范围</span><strong>游戏 · 依赖 · 加载器</strong></div></section>
<section class="mirror-section"><div class="mirror-section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND THE ESSENTIALS</div><h2>从第一块方块开始。</h2></div><p>连接官方上游，按类别缓存或直接下载。<br>原版内容与加载环境，各有归处。</p></div><div class="mirror-feature-grid"><article><span class="mirror-feature-number">01 / MINECRAFT</span><h3>游戏与原版资源</h3><p>正式版、快照与历史版本的清单、客户端、服务端、资源索引，以及音效与语言文件。</p><span class="mirror-pill">按哈希去重</span></article><article><span class="mirror-feature-number">02 / RUNTIME</span><h3>依赖与运行环境</h3><p>游戏依赖库、平台原生库和 Mojang Java 运行时，保留官方路径与原始文件内容。</p><span class="mirror-pill">支持断点续传</span></article><article><span class="mirror-feature-number">03 / LOADERS</span><h3>加载器，从这里出发</h3><p>Forge、NeoForge、Fabric 与 Quilt 的官方元数据及允许的运行依赖路径，按需回源。</p><span class="mirror-pill">模组默认关闭</span></article></div></section>
<section id="mirror-connect" class="mirror-connect"><div class="mirror-section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">ONE ADDRESS. MANY WORLDS.</div><h2>为你的启动器接入。</h2></div><button class="secondary" type="button" @click="copy">{{ copyState }}</button></div><div class="mirror-address"><span>当前镜像地址</span><code>{{ mirrorAddress }}</code><small>与译文平台共用域名</small></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="mirror-endpoints"><thead><tr><th>内容</th><th>镜像路径</th><th>官方来源</th><th>当前策略</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="row in endpoints" :key="row[0]"><td>{{ row[0] }}</td><td><code>{{ row[1] }}</code></td><td>{{ row[2] }}</td><td>{{ modes[policies[row[3]]] || "读取中" }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="muted small">启动器需按文档映射下载 URL；元数据保留官方内容，尚未提供 BMCLAPI 的 Forge 查询等全部接口。模组默认关闭，可由管理员启用固定来源文件的按需缓存或重定向。整合包、第三方资源包与光影不提供。OptiFine、旧版 Oracle Java 与 LiteLoader 暂不提供。</p></section>
<section class="mirror-section"><div class="eyebrow">DIRECT TO THE SOURCE</div><h2>已有稳定来源的文件，直接抵达。</h2><p class="muted">当前启用 {{ sourceCount }} 条公开文件直接映射。命中映射的依赖由对应 Maven 或公开源直接提供，跳过本地缓存和预下载；客户端下载后继续验证官方清单的哈希。</p><p class="muted small">Java 发行版的 Linux 安装包可以独立获取，Mojang 运行时仍按原清单下载。具体来源规则由管理员维护。</p></section>
<section class="mirror-bottom"><div><div class="eyebrow">READ. DISCOVER. PLAY.</div><h2>资源准备好了，也读懂它。</h2><p>共享多语言项目介绍，继续探索你的下一种玩法。</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/">打开共享译文库 →</a></section>
<section id="mirror-network" class="mirror-section"><div class="mirror-section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SHARE THE WAY FORWARD</div><h2>接入下载，也成为下一站。</h2></div><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/vdjango/minecraft-resource-translations" target="_blank" rel="noopener">获取开源服务 ↗</a></div><p class="muted">本机、社区资源节点与公开来源协同。按健康和权重分流，在流量或空间预算附近转移下载；稳定公开文件直接访问对应来源。</p><div class="mirror-feature-grid"><article><span class="mirror-feature-number">01 / CONNECT</span><h3>为启动器接入</h3><p>按上表映射下载地址，保留官方文件与哈希。支持 HEAD、Range；收到 307 时跟随跳转，失败后重试镜像地址。</p><a href="#mirror-connect">查看接入路径 →</a></article><article><span class="mirror-feature-number">02 / HOST</span><h3>部署自己的资源节点</h3><p>克隆开源项目，安装 Python 依赖，启动独立资源进程。配置自己的 HTTPS 域名、六类策略、缓存空间与出口预算。</p><code>python -m mc_translate.mirror</code><p class="muted small">仓库 deploy/resource-node.example.json 和 docs/资源节点部署.md 提供配置。资源节点不需要翻译模型密钥。</p></article><article><span class="mirror-feature-number">03 / JOIN</span><h3>提交节点，分担下载</h3><p>将节点地址、区域、开放的资源类别与可提供的带宽提交给管理员；管理员核对后加入。健康检查通过后，用户直接从你的节点下载。</p><a href="https://github.com/vdjango/minecraft-resource-translations/issues/new?title=Resource%20node%20application" target="_blank" rel="noopener">提交资源节点信息 ↗</a></article></div><div class="mirror-network-state"><strong>{{ accepting ? '本机按预算提供下载' : '本机优先转移资源下载' }}</strong><span>已通过检查的协作节点：{{ nodes.length }}</span><a v-for="node in nodes" :key="node.url" :href="node.url+'/mirror-api/status'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ node.url }} ↗</a><p v-if="!nodes.length" class="muted small">目前没有已通过检查的外部资源节点，下载仍按本地策略回退公开来源或官方。译文社区节点见「社区节点」。</p></div></section>
</main><footer><span>Buggcraft Resources</span><span>独立官方源缓存 · 资源版权归原权利人所有</span></footer>
